    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SHOP SIMULATOR: SUPERMARKET \u2013 DESIGN, SELL &amp; EXPAND \u2013 YOUR SUCCESS IS IN YOUR HANDS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your entrepreneurial skills to the test in Shop Simulator: Supermarket. Immerse yourself in the world of retail and start your own business today! Will your small shop become a successful supermarket? It's in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing with friends is even more fun. Coordinate your teammates, give orders via in-game voice chat, and fulfill your customers' wishes. Together, you can make the supermarket of your dreams a success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>GAME FEATURES:</u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DESIGN YOUR SHOP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886550/extras/fb3c8697ebc2577c9c062fb6a175f7a6.poster.avif?t=1750163749\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886550/extras/fb3c8697ebc2577c9c062fb6a175f7a6.webm?t=1750163749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Design your store exactly the way you want it. Choose from various shelves and decorations, place products as you like, and set their prices. Build the shop of your dreams!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAXIMIZE YOUR PROFITS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor stock levels, analyze sales data, and optimize your inventory to meet your customers' needs. Keep an eye on market prices and order strategically to maximize your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPAND AND GROW</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your shop and diversify your inventory to bring even more variety to your business. Hire employees to be able to focus on the critical aspects of your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MONEY MAKES THE WORLD GO 'ROUND</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886550/extras/405bbae69e1dcc386c3eaef031d45e18.poster.avif?t=1750163749\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886550/extras/405bbae69e1dcc386c3eaef031d45e18.webm?t=1750163749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Scan products, charge the correct amount, and ensure that customers leave your store happy and satisfied. If too many customers come in, you can open a second checkout and staff it with an AI employee or a fellow player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CLICK &amp; COLLECT ORDERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move with the times and also accept online orders to reduce your customers' waiting time and make additional profits. But be careful: you need to prepare the right products to satisfy the customer and complete the order successfully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY SOLO OR AS A TEAM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Setting up the store, stocking shelves, setting prices, ringing up customers, decorating... Everything is easier and more fun as a team! Work together like in real life and coordinate tasks using the proximity voice chat. The multiplayer mode for up to 4 players offers the ultimate supermarket fun! </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SHOP SIMULATOR: SUPERMARKET \u2013 DESIGN, SELL &amp; EXPAND \u2013 YOUR SUCCESS IS IN YOUR HANDS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your entrepreneurial skills to the test in Shop Simulator: Supermarket. Immerse yourself in the world of retail and start your own business today! Will your small shop become a successful supermarket? It's in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing with friends is even more fun. Coordinate your teammates, give orders via in-game voice chat, and fulfill your customers' wishes. Together, you can make the supermarket of your dreams a success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>GAME FEATURES:</u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DESIGN YOUR SHOP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886550/extras/fb3c8697ebc2577c9c062fb6a175f7a6.poster.avif?t=1750163749\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886550/extras/fb3c8697ebc2577c9c062fb6a175f7a6.webm?t=1750163749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Design your store exactly the way you want it. Choose from various shelves and decorations, place products as you like, and set their prices. Build the shop of your dreams!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAXIMIZE YOUR PROFITS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor stock levels, analyze sales data, and optimize your inventory to meet your customers' needs. Keep an eye on market prices and order strategically to maximize your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPAND AND GROW</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your shop and diversify your inventory to bring even more variety to your business. Hire employees to be able to focus on the critical aspects of your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MONEY MAKES THE WORLD GO 'ROUND</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886550/extras/405bbae69e1dcc386c3eaef031d45e18.poster.avif?t=1750163749\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886550/extras/405bbae69e1dcc386c3eaef031d45e18.webm?t=1750163749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Scan products, charge the correct amount, and ensure that customers leave your store happy and satisfied. If too many customers come in, you can open a second checkout and staff it with an AI employee or a fellow player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CLICK &amp; COLLECT ORDERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move with the times and also accept online orders to reduce your customers' waiting time and make additional profits. But be careful: you need to prepare the right products to satisfy the customer and complete the order successfully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY SOLO OR AS A TEAM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Setting up the store, stocking shelves, setting prices, ringing up customers, decorating... Everything is easier and more fun as a team! Work together like in real life and coordinate tasks using the proximity voice chat. The multiplayer mode for up to 4 players offers the ultimate supermarket fun! </p>",
    "short_description": "DESIGN, SELL &amp; EXPAND \u2013 YOUR SUCCESS IS IN YOUR HANDS. Put your entrepreneurial skills to the test in Shop Simulator: Supermarket. Immerse yourself in the world of retail and start your own business today!",
